{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After descending into a broken underworld, you must learn to traverse Satan Hill. Rocket-jump using exploding fireballs, unlock abilities and master an ever-growing movement system. Explore the non-linear corners of the underworld, defeat demons, find secrets  and reclaim the Eye of Evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the explosion force of fireballs to master rocket-jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique tools and abilities which help you reach new areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear, explore and collect items in whatever order you choose</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master movement</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the deep movement system</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many abilities interact with each other in interesting ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the world the way you like using precise movement and some creativity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter strange enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be observant, enemies do not always act as you expect</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737610?t=1760872793","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/37c89e1c60c95a8351293cf69e26011bd41aa787/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760872793","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/f96bd7dfc68aa9b38088d7e1d248b41cddb52aa5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760872793","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/f96bd7dfc68aa9b38088d7e1d248b41cddb52aa5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760872793